    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In the opponent’s [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), pick your **BEAST SNAGGA** unit if an enemy it is engaged with gets picked to [Fall Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back). That enemy has to use [Desperate Escape](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape-2) mode. A retreating **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** makes three extra [Hazard Rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls) for every engaged **BEAST SNAGGA** unit. Subtract 1 from those extra rolls if the retreating unit is Battle-shocked.",
